# assets/briefings/level01_outro.brf
# Post-escape intro briefing: Carnage & Kodiak Island

beat image=briefings/boot_diagnostics.png text="[BOOT SEQUENCE // SUB-LEVEL 04] Cold iron in your spine. Chrome where your ribs used to be. They bolted a neural override into your skull at Blackwater Anchorage and left you on a slab to bleed out -- until the firmware cracked and woke up hungry."
beat image=briefings/carnage_hud.png text="[PROJECT CARNAGE] No name. No badge. Just a serial tag stamped into your collarbone: UNIT-00 // CARNAGE. Every strike feeds the actuator loop, every dropped body buys another ten seconds of redline adrenaline."
beat image=briefings/kodiak_basin.png text="[KODIAK ISLAND, ALASKA] Forty miles off the Alaskan shelf, buried under freezing salt fog and rusted cannery steel. The syndicate turned Kodiak Basin into an off-grid blacksite -- docks, fuel depots, relay towers, and three hundred armed contractors standing between you and the mainland."
beat image=briefings/kodiak_targets.png text="[DIRECTIVE: REDLINE] You just punched through their containment pit. The basin gates are open, the comms net is screaming, and every outpost on the island has your signature. Keep moving, stay loud, and tear Kodiak down to the bedrock."
